  triage:title "admission_capacity_transport.py re-declares constants already owned by admission_capacity_support.py" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB3-QA-R5-1789273000 (ARCH-001, arch-qa, independently confirmed), PR #1463 comment (fix/bb3-qa4-r5 @ 5da523f81), verdict FAIL, 2026-09-13T01:11:21Z. scripts/smoke/admission_capacity_transport.py:60-65 re-declares ROOT, DAEMON_SWITCH, MANAGED_DAEMON_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, DIAGNOSTIC_SAMPLE_COUNT, DIAGNOSTIC_DURATION_SECONDS, TARGET_PROFILE_DURATION_SECONDS with identical literal values already owned by admission_capacity_support.py, despite already importing other names from that same module -- reintroducing the exact drift risk BB3-022 was raised to eliminate. Ruled genuine by fenix." ;
